# ============ AI Provider Configuration ============
# AI provider configuration is now managed via MongoDB and Settings page
# Do NOT set AI_PROVIDER, GEMINI_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY in .env anymore
# Instead, use the Settings page (/line-support/settings) to configure AI provider and API keys

# Encryption key for storing API keys in database (32 bytes = 64 hex chars)
# Generate: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
